	"actor-apc-husk-name": "APC (Destroyed)",
	"actor-apc.description": "Armed infantry transport. Armed infantry transport. Can attack Aircraft. Strong vs Vehicles Weak vs Infantry",
	"actor-apc.encyclopedia": "The APC (Armored Personnel Carrier) transports infantry, making it handy for capturing civilian structures. While its flak gun does not do much damage to enemy vehicles, the APC can resist enemy shots while your Hum-vees deal the damage. The APC (Armored Personnel Carrier) transports infantry, making it handy for capturing civilian structures. While its flak gun does not do much damage to enemy vehicles, the APC can resist enemy shots while your Hum-vees deal the damage. It also functions as your primary AA unit; if you hit the stop command, it'll retarget onto any nearby enemy air units.",
	"actor-apc.name": "APC",
	"actor-arco-husk-name": "Oil Pump (Destroyed)",
	"actor-arco-name": "Oil Pump",
	"actor-arty-husk-name": "Artillery (Destroyed)",
	"actor-arty.description": "Long-range artillery. Long-range artillery. Strong vs Infantry, Vehicles and Buildings",
	"actor-arty.encyclopedia": "Nod's artillery is a glass cannon, fragile but dealing large amounts of damage at long range. Particularly strong vs structures and infantry, it can destroy stationary tanks. Nod's artillery is a glass cannon, fragile but dealing large amounts of damage at long range. Particularly strong vs structures and infantry, it can destroy stationary tanks. Highly vulnerable when clumped due to its explosion on death.",
	"actor-arty.name": "Artillery",
	"actor-atwr.description": "All-purpose defensive structure. All-purpose defensive structure. Strong vs Aircraft and Infantry Weak vs Tanks",
	"actor-atwr.encyclopedia": "Advanced defense for GDI that fires volleys of high explosive missiles at both ground and air targets. Effective versus everything. Advanced defense for GDI that fires volleys of high explosive missiles at both ground and air targets. Effective versus everything.",
	"actor-atwr.name": "Advanced Guard Tower",
	"actor-barb-name": "Barbwire Fence",
	"actor-barracks-name": "Infantry Production",
	"actor-bggy-husk-name": "Nod Buggy (Destroyed)",
	"actor-bggy.description": "Fast scout and anti-infantry vehicle. Fast scout and anti-infantry vehicle. Strong vs Infantry Weak vs Tanks",
	"actor-bggy.encyclopedia": "Strong versus light vehicles and infantry, Buggies are great at scouting and killing isolated infantry. Though it is a little cheaper and faster than the GDI Hum-vee, they are more fragile. Strong versus light vehicles and infantry, Buggies are great at scouting and killing isolated infantry. Though it is a little cheaper and faster than the GDI Hum-vee, they are more fragile.",
	"actor-bggy.name": "Nod Buggy",
	"actor-bike-husk-name": "Recon Bike (Destroyed)",
	"actor-bike.description": "Fast scout vehicle with rockets. Fast scout vehicle with rockets. Can attack Aircraft. Strong vs Vehicles and Tanks Weak vs Infantry",
	"actor-bike.encyclopedia": "The Nod bike is a very fast vehicle armed with armor-piercing rockets, which makes it great for hit and run and harvester harassment. The Nod bike is a very fast vehicle armed with armor-piercing rockets, which makes it great for hit and run and harvester harassment. Be wary that its rockets are slow and have a hard time hitting fast-moving targets.",
	"actor-bike.name": "Recon Bike",
	"actor-bio-husk-name": "Biological Lab (Destroyed)",
	"actor-bio.capturable-desc": "Capture to enable Tiberium immunity for infantry.",
	"actor-bio.captured-desc": "Provides infantry with Tiberium immunity.",
	"actor-bio.encyclopedia": "Grants friendly infantry immunity to Tiberium when captured. Grants friendly infantry immunity to Tiberium when captured.",
	"actor-bio.name": "Biological Lab",
	"actor-boat-name": "Gunboat",
	"actor-brik.description": "Stops infantry and most tanks. Stops infantry and most tanks. Blocks some projectiles.",
	"actor-brik.encyclopedia": "Blocks all unit movement, except for Mammoth Tanks which can crush it. Immune to small arms fire. Blocks all unit movement, except for Mammoth Tanks which can crush it. Immune to small arms fire. This barrier can be built in multiple segments once an initial wall has been placed.",
