	"actor-camera-small-name": "(reveals small area to owner)",
	"actor-chan-name": "Dr. Chan",
	"actor-cycl.description": "Stops infantry and light vehicles. Stops infantry and light vehicles. Can be crushed by tanks.",
	"actor-cycl.encyclopedia": "Blocks movement of infantry and light vehicles, but can be crushed by tanks. Immune to small arms fire. Blocks movement of infantry and light vehicles, but can be crushed by tanks. Immune to small arms fire. This barrier can be built in multiple segments once an initial chain link has been placed.",
