	"actor-gun.encyclopedia": "Base defense armed with an armor-piercing cannon, it deals significant damage to vehicles in range. Base defense armed with an armor-piercing cannon, it deals significant damage to vehicles in range.",
	"actor-gun.name": "Turret",
	"actor-hand.description": "Trains infantry.",
	"actor-hand.encyclopedia": "Produces infantry for Nod. Once unlocked, advanced Nod infantry are slow but have high health pools. Produces infantry for Nod. Once unlocked, advanced Nod infantry are slow but have high health pools.",
