	"actor-heli.encyclopedia": "Has more health than the Orca and acts as a support unit. It works well with artillery, as it can kill approaching light vehicles. Has more health than the Orca and acts as a support unit. It works well with artillery, as it can kill approaching light vehicles. Ammo is automatically reloaded in the air.",
