	"actor-moneycrate-name": "Money Crate",
	"actor-mpspawn-name": "(multiplayer starting point)",
	"actor-msam-husk-name": "Rocket Launcher (Destroyed)",
	"actor-msam.description": "Long-range rocket artillery. Long-range rocket artillery. Strong vs all ground units",
	"actor-msam.encyclopedia": "Referred to as  “MLRS” by players (Multiple Launch Rocket System), this artillery platform fires volleys of rockets at distant targets. It is particularly effective against light vehicles and does moderate damage vs infantry, buildings, and heavy armor. Referred to as  “MLRS” by players (Multiple Launch Rocket System), this artillery platform fires volleys of rockets at distant targets. It is particularly effective against light vehicles and does moderate damage vs infantry, buildings, and heavy armor. A strong unit to build vs enemy artillery, its high bullet velocity and damage to light vehicles makes it the perfect counter to Nod artillery.",
	"actor-msam.name": "Rocket Launcher",
	"actor-mtnk-husk-name": "Medium Tank (Destroyed)",
	"actor-mtnk.description": "General-purpose GDI Tank. General-purpose GDI Tank. Strong vs Tanks and Vehicles Weak vs Infantry",
	"actor-mtnk.encyclopedia": "The workhorse of GDI, offering a good balance of speed, durability and firepower. It will easily destroy Nod light tanks and can tear through structures if it sneaks into a base. The workhorse of GDI, offering a good balance of speed, durability and firepower. It will easily destroy Nod light tanks and can tear through structures if it sneaks into a base. Mix minigunners with your medium tank armies to deal with enemy infantry.",
	"actor-mtnk.name": "Medium Tank",
	"actor-nuk2.description": "Provides more power, cheaper than the Provides more power, cheaper than the standard Power Plant.",
	"actor-nuk2.encyclopedia": "Provides more power to the structures in your base, making it more cost-effective than the Power Plant. Power output is directly related to its condition, so protect it during battle. Provides more power to the structures in your base, making it more cost-effective than the Power Plant. Power output is directly related to its condition, so protect it during battle.",
