	"actor-nuke.name": "Power Plant",
	"actor-obli.description": "Advanced base defense. Advanced base defense. Requires power to operate. Strong vs all Ground units Cannot target Aircraft",
	"actor-obli.encyclopedia": "Advanced defense for Nod that quickly destroys ground targets with a powerful laser. Advanced defense for Nod that quickly destroys ground targets with a powerful laser.",
	"actor-obli.name": "Obelisk of Light",
	"actor-orca-husk-name": "Orca (Destroyed)",
	"actor-orca.description": "Helicopter gunship with AG missiles. Helicopter gunship with AG missiles. Strong vs Buildings and Tanks Weak vs Infantry",
	"actor-orca.encyclopedia": "Fast but fragile, the Orca harasses enemy vehicles and aircraft with AT missiles. It is best used opportunistically, and can be kept alive longer with careful micro. Its AA missiles are effective but have a hard time hitting fast-moving air targets. Fast but fragile, the Orca harasses enemy vehicles and aircraft with AT missiles. It is best used opportunistically, and can be kept alive longer with careful micro. Its AA missiles are effective but have a hard time hitting fast-moving air targets. Ammo is automatically reloaded in the air.",
	"actor-orca.name": "Orca",
	"actor-prison-name": "Prison",
	"actor-proc.description": "Processes raw Tiberium Processes raw Tiberium into usable resources.",
	"actor-proc.encyclopedia": "Stores and processes the alien material and resource, Tiberium. Harvesters collect Tiberium in the field and deposit it at the refinery, where it is converted into credits. Stores and processes the alien material and resource, Tiberium. Harvesters collect Tiberium in the field and deposit it at the refinery, where it is converted into credits. The refinery stores Tiberium and immediately deploys a harvester once constructed. 3 harvesters is the maximum it can handle for close refining.",
	"actor-proc.name": "Tiberium Refinery",
	"actor-pvice.description": "Mutated abomination that spits liquid Tiberium. Mutated abomination that spits liquid Tiberium. Strong vs Infantry and Buildings Weak vs Aircraft",
	"actor-pvice.encyclopedia": "A mutated lifeform created from the strange properties of Tiberium, when infantry units are expose to it. A mutated lifeform created from the strange properties of Tiberium, when infantry units are expose to it. They regenerate health quickly and have a short-range Tiberium weapon.",
	"actor-pyle.description": "Trains infantry.",
