	"actor-rmbo.description": "Elite sniper infantry unit. Elite sniper infantry unit. Strong vs Infantry and Buildings Weak vs Vehicles",
	"actor-rmbo.encyclopedia": "Equipped with a long-range sniper rifle, the Commando fires slowly but can eliminate enemy infantry from a distance when well-supported. Equipped with a long-range sniper rifle, the Commando fires slowly but can eliminate enemy infantry from a distance when well-supported. It carries C4, for surprise backline structure destruction.",
