	"actor-sbag.encyclopedia": "Blocks movement of infantry and light vehicles, but can be crushed by tanks. Immune to small arms fire. Blocks movement of infantry and light vehicles, but can be crushed by tanks. Immune to small arms fire. This barrier can be built in multiple segments once an initial sandbag has been placed.",
