	"actor-stnk.encyclopedia": "Cloaked units that become visible when damaged or firing their weapons. They can also be detected by defenses within a small radius or infantry at a one-cell range. Cloaked units that become visible when damaged or firing their weapons. They can also be detected by defenses within a small radius or infantry at a one-cell range. Their long-range AP missiles are excellent for dealing with enemy armor or air. They can also crush infantry in a pinch.",
